    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action adventure game where you can explore 4 floating islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Adventure while managing oxygen levels with items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Randomly spawned pop characters attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-At first, you start with nothing, but fight with weapons in hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-There is also inventory management, shops, and score mini-games along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World View</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four open-world floating islands above the clouds. These islands were once filled with enough air for humans to live in, even though they were in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In that world, a device developed by a doctor who survived before the monsters took over the world activates a mochi-shaped doll android (SatatiRoid) SR. This android's body is made of mochi, so it can function to a certain extent even in a low-oxygen environment. You don't have to collect them as you go on your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a limited adventure with a constant abnormality in status, and a program is started to restore the floating world that was once full of oxygen.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action adventure game where you can explore 4 floating islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Adventure while managing oxygen levels with items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Randomly spawned pop characters attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-At first, you start with nothing, but fight with weapons in hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-There is also inventory management, shops, and score mini-games along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World View</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four open-world floating islands above the clouds. These islands were once filled with enough air for humans to live in, even though they were in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In that world, a device developed by a doctor who survived before the monsters took over the world activates a mochi-shaped doll android (SatatiRoid) SR. This android's body is made of mochi, so it can function to a certain extent even in a low-oxygen environment. You don't have to collect them as you go on your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a limited adventure with a constant abnormality in status, and a program is started to restore the floating world that was once full of oxygen.</p>",
